  "question": {
    "text": "A ball (initially at rest) falls vertically for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> and hits a smooth plane inclined at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>°</mo></math> to the horizontal. The coefficient of restitution is <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>5</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>. The distance along the plane between the first and second impact of the ball is"
  },
